{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"6":"Chapters Regarding Funerals"},"section_detail":{"6":{"hadithnumber_first":1433,"hadithnumber_last":1637,"arabicnumber_first":1433,"arabicnumber_last":1637,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1495,"arabicnumber":1495,"text":"حدثنا احمد بن منيع، حدثنا زيد بن الحباب، حدثنا ابراهيم بن عثمان، عن الحكم، عن مقسم، عن ابن عباس، ان النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قرا على الجنازة بفاتحة الكتاب","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":6,"hadith":63}}]}